msgid "Start the cranberries on the left burner."
msgstr "Postaw żurawinę na lewym palniku."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Starting before its call is a fumble."
msgstr "Start przed wezwaniem to wpadka."

#. one sentence of a longer line
